Maintainer: Florian Asche <github@florian-asche.de>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/florian-asche/PiCompose-Package-Archive-Keyring
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: picompose-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: PiCompose APT repository signing key and source
 Installs the GPG key that signs the PiCompose APT repository and the
 apt source entry for the stable suite. Keeping the key in a package lets
 it be renewed or replaced with a normal upgrade.
